<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FMC featured stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FMC featured stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Monday it had named FMC Corp the featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares rose 1/2 to 74-7/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
